    "parsing_res_list": [
        {
            "block_label": "header",
            "block_content": "Trust Deed for a Self Managed Superannuation Fund.",
            "block_bbox": [
                303,
                83,
                883,
                115
            ],
            "block_id": 0,
            "block_order": null
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "j.to ensure that the Fund is operated in a way consistent with all relevant.legislation, in order to comply with the requirements of a \"Complying.Superannuation Fund\" under the SISA..\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                225,
                167,
                1035,
                259
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 1
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "FUND - Objectives:",
            "block_bbox": [
                112,
                327,
                343,
                354
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. The objective and sole purpose of the Fund is to provide retirement benefits to the Fund Member/s.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                149,
                417,
                1069,
                471
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "6. The Fund will only undertake investment activities with the contributions of Fund Members which are prudent, and consistent with the intention of providing retirement benefits to Fund Members..\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                145,
                534,
                1070,
                618
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "7. In particular, the Fund is not permitted to engage in investment strategies or.products that:",
            "block_bbox": [
                142,
                684,
                1010,
                741
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. are speculative in nature;",
            "block_bbox": [
                222,
                778,
                540,
                802
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 6
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. would not be utilised by similar Funds; and.",
            "block_bbox": [
                221,
                837,
                744,
                862
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 7
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. would not be reasonably likely to produce stable, consistent, regular.returns on equity.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                221,
                898,
                1017,
                954
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 8
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "8. To this end, the investment of Members contributions will be conducted in accordance with the Investment Strategy..\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                145,
                1020,
                1011,
                1080
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 9
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "MEMBER/S - Membership; Definitions and Meetings ",
            "block_bbox": [
                110,
                1178,
                732,
                1203
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 10
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "9. Fund Membership:",
            "block_bbox": [
                149,
                1268,
                414,
                1292
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 11
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The Membership of the Fund Consists of the Member and Trustees of the.Fund (as amended from time to time).\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                228,
                1322,
                1072,
                1383
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 12
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. Any such amendment will be affected by a written variation to this Deed..",
            "block_bbox": [
